          "message": "http2: verify :athority in push promise requests\n\nRFC 7540 says we should verify that the push is for an \"authoritative\"\nserver. We make sure of this by only allowing push with an :athority\nheader that matches the host that was asked for in the URL.\n\nFixes #3577\nReported-by: Nicolas Grekas\nBug: https://curl.haxx.se/mail/lib-2019-02/0057.html\nCloses #3581",
          "tree": {
            "sha": "ca8573ac9127aa9e193777cd6bb89bf34bd92e4c",
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/curl/git/trees/ca8573ac9127aa9e193777cd6bb89bf34bd92e4c"
          },
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/curl/git/commits/aa5a28bd697d652f78ba471022092e148d0b6e4f",
          "comment_count": 0,
          "verification": {
            "verified": true,
            "reason": "valid",
            "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQFDBAABCgAtFiEEJ+3q8i86vOtQ25oSXMkI/bceEsIFAlxs/0IPHGRhbmllbEBo\nYXh4LnNlAAoJEFzJCP23HhLC/vUH/1A+PHW2r+4dP5LKR63HguZnn3Bq2dYfYdtj\nXWsXcikQ0WV1nL8p5wQozrx9G/cIiOVSsI1C+oAb8m2tbA2Gg4rNtFsjy1AaUv+e\npeKBD+9ZK9JjewfRGi1ghAUD/IOv6PrXOC5lH++7nkQMTJQjxwT/4R/DDctAVDxZ\n2owi63YpbWbGFB2jJIDJ+P2eI+yuabYVOEyYjOo+MNRyHvtj+S/QoMAi0QuEuBRM\nzuxl2aNPXqyZTRcTZrGNfQPexmmz8BuJGN3rRQBukPxpHXaQi/Thl2oAaZlKiJGU\nBChMWor5VU8ltwISLoqb0QSJ7pDAW6h0pbe3+VCQgPQRdBQiPbU=\n=goBV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----",
            "payload": "tree ca8573ac9127aa9e193777cd6bb89bf34bd92e4c\nparent afc00e047c773faeaa60a5f86a246cbbeeba5819\nauthor Daniel Stenberg <daniel@haxx.se> 1550477401 +0100\ncommitter Daniel Stenberg <daniel@haxx.se> 1550647082 +0100\n\nhttp2: verify :athority in push promise requests\n\nRFC 7540 says we should verify that the push is for an \"authoritative\"\nserver. We make sure of this by only allowing push with an :athority\nheader that matches the host that was asked for in the URL.\n\nFixes #3577\nReported-by: Nicolas Grekas\nBug: https://curl.haxx.se/mail/lib-2019-02/0057.html\nCloses #3581\n"
          }
        },
